    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. a lot of the stakeholders i'm talking to say these arguments are basically just NIMBY stuff to stop progress and keep prices high. do you think there's any actual substance to those criticisms, or is it mostly just people being resistant to change?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
